-- Guards: step 0 is a DO block that aborts the whole block unless every touched row is at its pre-state signature (= prod after
-- 20261015130000) or at its post-state signature (re-run) — this is the ORDER GUARD: without 20261015130000 the five M820-24 rows do not
-- match and nothing is written. Every UPDATE additionally matches its own pre-state signature. Fields md5(description md5 | visible_when |
-- consumer_worksheets | enum md5 | label_de | label_en | is_required | data_type | verification_quote md5 | source_anchor), active only;
-- gates md5(condition | severity | description md5 | clause_reference). The drivers are INSERTed only when their symbol is absent on M820-17 / M820-23.
-- Idempotent (a re-run changes nothing). In-transaction archives compliance_requirements_archive_m820_c4d / fields_archive_m820_c4d + ledger
