-- severity changes; no new gate; saved project values are not touched.
-- Rollback:  scripts/rollback-20261015150000-m820-1-c4-phase-drivers.sql (byte-equal; a row edited after the apply is left alone).
-- Read-back: scripts/verification/apply/readback-20261015150000-m820-1-c4-phase-drivers.sql.
-- Order: AFTER 20261015130000 (820-1 F1 procurement guards, staged on this branch) — enforced by step 0, proven in the harness. Roll back in
--   reverse order (this block first); rolling back 20261015130000 first leaves the five M820-24 rows alone (its rollback is byte-equal),
--   proven in the harness. INDEPENDENT of 20261014100000 (follow-up O-2/O-3, 820-2 rows only) and of 20261015140000 (820-2 rows only):
--   disjoint rows, own *_m820_c4d tables.
-- Code: hiding and gate guards are data only (visible_when + hidden-at-source R-14 … R-16 live in bd1d1fd). C-9 listing: phase_vergabeverfahren_erreicht
--   is listed by this branch's rule; phase_auftrag_erteilt needs the phase-deferral.ts change of data/m820-2-c4-phase-guards — deploy that code
--   before or with this block, else the award driver is hidden/guarding but not listed.
-- RELAXES WHEN QUESTIONS ARE ASKED (no severity change) → owner go needed before the apply (same class as R-O2-1).
